## Input

```css
$dark: true;

.a {
  background: url(if(sass($dark): "dark.png"; else: "light.png"));
  background: url(if(sass($dark): "dark.png"));
  background: url(if(not sass($dark): "light.png"; else: "dark.png";));
  background: url(if($dark, "dark.png", "light.png"));
}

